        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Tour\n- Organizations: Rice University\n- Products: nanocar\n- Roles: synthetic organic chemist, professor\n- Topics: nanotechnology\n\nFacts:\n- In 2005, the nanocar was designed as a molecule at Rice University by a group led by Professor James Tour.\n- James M. Tour is a synthetic organic chemist who specializes in nanotechnology.\n- James Tour is the T. T. and W. F. Chao Professor of Chemistry at Rice University in Houston, Texas, United States.\n- James Tour is also Professor of Materials Science and NanoEngineering and Professor of Computer Science at Rice University.",
